# Dependencies' install scripts (preinstall/install/postinstall) do not run: they are the main path of the
# 2026 npm supply-chain attacks. Measured by CCO on 2026-10-22 (claude-code-template docs/drafts/
# npm-supply-chain-20261022.md): npm ci, tsc, unit tests, next build and wrangler deploy --dry-run all pass
# with this on, because the native binaries come from platform-specific optional dependencies.
# This also skips pre/post scripts of `npm run X`; this repo has none.
# One thing it does stop: puppeteer's Chrome download. On a new machine run once:
#   npx puppeteer browsers install chrome
ignore-scripts=true
